  <p id="c-suishu-048-yangsu-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-suishu-048-yangsu-family-context:p001:m0000" ref="7hw_8jq_c1e_AAAAA">楊素</persName>，字<persName id="c-suishu-048-yangsu-family-context:p001:m0004" ref="7hw_8jq_c1e_AAAAA">處道</persName>，弘農華陰人也。祖<persName id="c-suishu-048-yangsu-family-context:p001:m0015" ref="7hw_8jq_c1e_AAA">暄</persName>，魏輔國將軍、諫議大夫。父<persName id="c-suishu-048-yangsu-family-context:p001:m0029" ref="7hw_8jq_c1e_AAAA">敷</persName>，周汾州刺史，沒於齊。</p>
